      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bullet-list",
      "data": {
        "items": [
          "Strong identity for users and services",
          "mTLS for service-to-service",
          "Authorization on every request",
          "Micro-segmentation with network policies",
          "Continuous monitoring"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "Zero Trust in Kubernetes"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Kubernetes supports zero trust with service accounts, network policies, RBAC, and service mesh mTLS. Each pod has an identity and policies control communication."
      }
    },
